# Board patches for xnu-12377 — sheng upstream, verbatim.
#
# This series is UniXNU-sheng origin/main's patches/xnu-12377/series, in its own order and
# unmodified, so the whole boot chain (start.s → arm_init → static_if → arm_vm_init → pmap)
# is sheng's design: T0SZ_USER=17 user pmaps, the TCR_EL1_KVA_ENTRY switch in arm_init_tramp,
# and pmap_apply_user_tcr() in arm_vm_init. There is no board framebuffer console in this tree;
# that is deliberate, it is what sheng boots with.
#
# Device-specific code lives outside the kernel series (drivers/, package/, dts/, defconfig),
# not here.
#
# native-ptrauth-null-portability.patch stays because it is a toolchain fix, not a kernel
# change: Apple clang accepts a fourth __ptrauth argument that upstream LLVM (the Linux
# toolchain this build uses) rejects.
native-ptrauth-null-portability.patch

